
// Transitions keep their control-flow semantics with scope capture:
// the stack is cleared, the transitioned beat's end is the script end
// (no return to parent), and the captured chain is resolution context
// only, dropped again by any further transition.

beat Main
  new state
    tone: "warm"

  beat Ending
    A $tone ending.
    -> Coda

  -> Ending
  This line never runs.

beat Coda
  Coda tone is $tone.

/*
<test>
- expected: |
    ~ A warm ending.

    ~ Coda tone is null.
</test>
*/
